        children: "flowchart LR\n    A[\"Initial: x units pure\"] --> B[\"Step 1: Remove y units\"]\n    B --> C[\"Remaining: x-y pure\"]\n    C --> D[\"Add y units water\"]\n    D --> E[\"Pure = x × (1 - y/x)\"]\n    E --> F[\"Repeat n times\"]\n    F --> G[\"Final Pure = x × (1 - y/x)^n\"]\n"
